WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.920
What’s the deepest dream of SCP-053,&nbsp;
the tragically dangerous Young Girl?

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:10.320
SCP Foundation researchers decided&nbsp;
to take a photo of SCP-053 with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.400
the Desire Camera while she sat around&nbsp;
coloring. What was the resulting photo?

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:22.160
“053 riding on SCP-682's back in a pastoral&nbsp;
setting; SCP-682 is wearing a bright red&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:27.280
hair-bow and a floral dress similar to&nbsp;
SCP-053's favored clothing, and has bright&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:32.880
pink nail polish on its claws. Adult humans are&nbsp;
present, but facial features are indistinct.”

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.640
Well, I can’t tell if that’s&nbsp;
wholesome or terrifying…

